<title>SRI LANKA: National Dev Bank says '96 net up 11 pct.</title>
<headline>National Dev Bank says '96 net up 11 pct.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-02-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Unaudited results of National Development Bank of Sri Lanka Ltd for the year ending 31 December, 1996.</p>
<p>(in millions of rupees unless stated):</p>
<p>			     1996		 1995</p>
<p>    Turnover	   2,856.59   vs    2,494.89</p>
<p>    Net profit	   706.98   vs	636.19</p>
<p>    Tax		    231.00   vs	232.00</p>
<p>NOTE - The blue Chip National Development Bank is one of two development finance institutions listed in Colombo.</p>
<p>--Colombo newsroom (941) 434319</p>
</text>
